) Ask the user for a caption, and collect it. Generate a properly oriented half-size version of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":188885,"global_rank":374607},{"name":"quinkennedy/flatmap","owner":"quinkennedy","html_url":"https://github.com/quinkennedy/flatmap","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":"an exploration of warping polylines into straight lines","topics":[],"score":188885,"global_rank":374614},{"name":"hectoregm/ios-programming-nerd-ranch","owner":"hectoregm","html_url":"https://github.com/hectoregm/ios-programming-nerd-ranch","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":188885,"global_rank":374615},{"name":"peterkuriyama/hlsimulator_old","owner":"peterkuriyama","html_url":"https://github.com/peterkuriyama/hlsimulator_old","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":[],"score":188885,"global_rank":374616},{"name":"leventeliu/load-agent","owner":"leventeliu","html_url":"https://github.com/leventeliu/load-agent","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":null,"topics":[],"score":188885,"global_rank":374623},{"name":"grantr/knative-docs-old","owner":"grantr","html_url":"https://github.com/grantr/knative-docs-old","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Go","description":"Documentation for users of Knative components (developers and operators)","topics":[],"score":188883,"global_rank":374628},{"name":"jackdweber/EasyVFL","owner":"jackdweber","html_